TITLE Pure water at pH 7.0 equilibrated with 10 moles of gypsum

SOLUTION 1
    pH      7.0
    temp    25.0
    units   mol/L
    water   1.0  # kg

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Gypsum   0.0   10.0

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file           gypsum_equilibrium.sel
    -reset          false
    -molalities     H2

END
